course: dictionary
lesson: 13327
title: Words about places and people
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words tell you where something comes from. Guatemalan is an adjective when it describes a thing, like Guatemalan coffee. It comes from Guatemala, a country in Central America, south of Mexico.
explain: Look at the ending. Guatemala is the place, and Guatemalan is the word for things and people from that place. Other words follow the same pattern: Mexico and Mexican, Peru and Peruvian.
explain: «My aunt bought a Guatemalan woven scarf at the market.» Here Guatemalan describes the scarf. «Ana is a Guatemalan who lives in our town.» Here Guatemalan names a person. Ask yourself: is it describing a thing, or naming a person?
fact: Guatemala is a country in Central America, south of Mexico.
fact: «Guatemalan» is an adjective when it describes something, as in «Guatemalan coffee».
fact: «A Guatemalan» is a noun for a person from Guatemala, and the plural is «Guatemalans».
fact: Many Guatemalans speak Spanish, and many speak Maya languages.
fact: The ancient Maya city of Tikal is in Guatemala.
exercise: «The coffee on the table is Guatemalan.» What kind of word is Guatemalan here? | A noun for a person | A verb, an action word | A number | *An adjective, because it describes the coffee
exercise: «Ana is a Guatemalan who lives near the park.» What does Guatemalan mean here? | A type of tree | A kind of hot drink | *A person from Guatemala
exercise: Which country is Guatemala? | Mexico, to the north of Guatemala | *Central America, south of Mexico | Spain, in Europe | Peru, in South America
test: Which word in «My uncle sells Guatemalan textiles» shows where the textiles come from? | uncle | sells | textiles | *Guatemalan
test: Tikal is an ancient Maya city. Which country is it in? | Peru | *Guatemala | Mexico | Spain
exam: Sofia writes, «Guatemalans speak Spanish and Maya languages.» What kind of word is Guatemalans in that sentence? | *A noun, because it names people | An adjective, because it describes a thing | A verb, an action word | A number
